              {
                "dsDescriptionValue": {
                  "typeName": "dsDescriptionValue",
                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "This dataset contains the files with the metadata of all the letters from the Belle van Zuylen (Isabelle de Charrière) edition (https://charriere.huygens.knaw.nl/, received as a .csv file from the Huygens Institute) plus the combined letter metadata with the CEN (the first and second degree network of van Zuylen's correspondents). It also includes screenshots of the network visualizations created with the program Gephi, used in a presentation about this woman by researcher Dirk van Miert."
                },
